    <bpmn:process id="W_W2147" name="W2147. Gift Card Distribution Channel Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly performance review or new channel activation
Frequency: Monthly review; ad-hoc activation
Volume: 4 channels: POS (70%), ecommerce (20%), app (5%), corporate (5%)
Owner: Marketing Operations Manager
Participants: Marketing Ops Mgr, VP Marketing
Source: workflow W2147 — Gift Card Distribution Channel Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2147_LaneSet2">
