    <bpmn:process id="W_W2148" name="W2148. Gift Card Compliance &amp; Regulatory Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: BSP regulation update or annual review
Frequency: Annual comprehensive; ad-hoc for changes
Volume: BSP stored-value regulations; Consumer Act; AMLA
Owner: Legal &amp; Compliance Officer
Participants: Legal Compliance Officer, VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Source: workflow W2148 — Gift Card Compliance &amp; Regulatory Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2148_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2148_Lane1" name="Legal Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2148_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2148_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2148_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2148_End6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2148_Start3" name="BSP regulation update or annual review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2148_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2148_Task4" name="Legal &amp; Compliance Officer monitors the regulatory framework: BSP…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal &amp; Compliance Officer monitors the regulatory framework: BSP stored-value-product rules (disclosure, expiry limits, consumer protection), RA 7394 Consumer Act (clear terms, no deceptive practices), RA 9160 AMLA (KYC on cash purchases ≥PHP 50K — single or aggregated), BIR revenue-recognition (PFRS 15 breakage)
Responsible (R): Legal Compliance Officer
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Annual + ad-hoc</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2148_Flow9</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2148_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2148_Task5" name="Officer ensures BuildRight&#x27;s program complies: T&amp;Cs posted, no expiry on sold…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Officer ensures BuildRight&#x27;s program complies: T&amp;Cs posted, no expiry on sold gift checks per RA 10962 (Gift Check Act of 2017 — valid until issued/used); program terms only on loyalty/promotional gift cards (RA 10962 §5-exempt), AMLA KYC triggered on the threshold, breakage accounting per PFRS 15
Responsible (R): Legal Compliance Officer
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2148_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2148_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2148_End6" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2148_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2148_Annotation7">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-211 (ensure stored-value float &amp; liability integrity.) | - CTL-391 (AMLA KYC — links to VS-86); CTL-211 (consumer-protection / stored-value expiry — links to VS-22 / W2682); operational: VP Legal annual compliance sign-off
Owner: Legal &amp; Compliance Officer</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W2148_Assoc8" sourceRef="W2148_Annotation7" targetRef="W2148_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
