      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2149_Task4" name="Category Manager reviews denomination performance: which denominations sell…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Category Manager reviews denomination performance: which denominations sell best, average load vs. face value, custom-load adoption; adjusts the standard-denomination set and the custom-load limits
Responsible (R): Category Manager
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: Semi-annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2149_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2149_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
